msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Authority Claim"
msgstr "权威主张"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A datable, attributed claim that a legal proposition has a stated authority status in one legal order, on one issue, for one forum. It is a claim token: the associated agent is the issuing body, the expressed proposition is the content, and force, opinion role, pinpoint source, relevant facts and time are separate facts. The claim records what a source says about authority and never settles the authority of the proposition in another legal order."
msgstr "一项可确定时间、有归属的主张，称某一法律命题在某一法律秩序中、就某一问题并针对某一审理机构具有特定的权威地位。它是一种主张令牌：相关联的行为主体即发布机构，所表达的命题即内容，效力、意见角色、精确出处、相关事实与时间均为各自独立的事实。该主张只记录某一来源对权威的陈述，绝不裁定该命题在其他法律秩序中的权威。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim a gmeow:AuthorityClaim ; gmeow:expresses ex:proposition ; gmeow:authorityOrder ex:legalOrder ; gmeow:authorityForce gmeow:authorityForceBinding ."
msgstr "ex:claim a gmeow:AuthorityClaim ; gmeow:expresses ex:proposition ; gmeow:authorityOrder ex:legalOrder ; gmeow:authorityForce gmeow:authorityForceBinding ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for a bare citation, which supplies no authority status (use gmeow:CitationAct), and for a specifically identified duty, permission or prohibition (use the rights rule through gmeow:authorityRule)."
msgstr "避免用于单纯的引用（引用不赋予任何权威地位，应使用 gmeow:CitationAct），也避免用于具体确定的义务、许可或禁止（应通过 gmeow:authorityRule 使用权利规则）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one claim per proposition, legal order and forum. Set gmeow:expresses, gmeow:authorityOrder, gmeow:authorityForce and gmeow:authorityIssue; add gmeow:opinionRole, gmeow:authoritySource, gmeow:relevantFact and gmeow:eventTime where the source gives them, and name the issuing body with gmeow:wasAssociatedWith."
msgstr "每个命题、法律秩序与审理机构各创建一项主张。设置 gmeow:expresses、gmeow:authorityOrder、gmeow:authorityForce 和 gmeow:authorityIssue；来源提供时再添加 gmeow:opinionRole、gmeow:authoritySource、gmeow:relevantFact 和 gmeow:eventTime，并以 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 指明发布机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record that an identified body or legal order puts a legal proposition forward as binding, persuasive, dissenting or unresolved, together with the evidence that status needs."
msgstr "用于记录某一已确认的机构或法律秩序将某一法律命题作为有约束力、有说服力、异议或未决的命题提出，并附上该地位所需的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Authority Force"
msgstr "权威效力"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The value vocabulary of the force an authority claim asserts for its proposition: binding, persuasive, dissent or unresolved. Each value is a claim about one legal order and forum, never a global verdict on the proposition."
msgstr "权威主张就其命题所断言的效力的取值词汇：有约束力、有说服力、异议或未决。每个取值都只是针对某一法律秩序和审理机构的主张，绝不是对该命题的全局裁决。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:authorityForcePersuasive a gmeow:AuthorityForce ."
msgstr "gmeow:authorityForcePersuasive a gmeow:AuthorityForce ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid per-value subclasses and avoid reading a value outside the claim's own legal order and forum."
msgstr "避免按取值建立子类，也避免在主张自身的法律秩序和审理机构之外解读取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach exactly one value to an authority claim with gmeow:authorityForce; binding requires a pinpoint source and a forum, persuasive requires a pinpoint source."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:authorityForce 为权威主张恰好附加一个取值；有约束力的效力需要精确出处和审理机构，有说服力的效力需要精确出处。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityForce|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the value vocabulary for the force a legal authority claim asserts."
msgstr "用作法律权威主张所断言效力的取值词汇。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Opinion Role"
msgstr "意见角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The value vocabulary of the role of the opinion in which a proposition appears: the reasons of the deciding body, a concurrence or a dissent."
msgstr "命题所出现的意见之角色的取值词汇：裁判机构的理由、协同意见或异议意见。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:opinionRoleDissenting a gmeow:OpinionRole ."
msgstr "gmeow:opinionRoleDissenting a gmeow:OpinionRole ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the force a claim asserts (use gmeow:AuthorityForce); the role says where the proposition appears, not what status it has."
msgstr "避免用于主张所断言的效力（应使用 gmeow:AuthorityForce）；角色说明命题出现在何处，而非其地位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach one value to an authority claim with gmeow:opinionRole; a dissenting role cannot carry binding force."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:opinionRole 为权威主张附加一个取值；异议角色不能带有约束效力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OpinionRole|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the value vocabulary for the opinion role of a legal proposition."
msgstr "用作法律命题意见角色的取值词汇。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Proposition Dependency"
msgstr "命题依赖"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicit dependency of one reading of a proposition on a proposition that another authority claim treats. Its existence flags the dependent reading for review and nothing else: it does not retract the earlier claim, reverse any decision that cited it, or make the treating claim binding for any other proposition."
msgstr "某一命题的一种解读对另一权威主张所处理的命题的明确依赖。它的存在只意味着该解读被标记为需要复核，别无他意：它不撤回先前的主张，不推翻任何引用过它的裁决，也不使处理主张对其他命题产生约束力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:dep a gmeow:PropositionDependency ; gmeow:dependencyReading ex:earlierClaim ; gmeow:dependencyProposition ex:earlierProposition ; gmeow:dependencyTreatment ex:laterClaim ."
msgstr "ex:dep a gmeow:PropositionDependency ; gmeow:dependencyReading ex:earlierClaim ; gmeow:dependencyProposition ex:earlierProposition ; gmeow:dependencyTreatment ex:laterClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for a citation alone: a citation, even a disagreeing one, flags nothing. Avoid linking readings of propositions the treating claim does not bear on."
msgstr "避免仅用于引用：引用即使表示不同意，也不标记任何内容。也避免关联处理主张并不涉及的命题的解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one dependency per affected reading. Name the reading, the proposition it depends on and the treating claim; review of the reading is a separate recorded act."
msgstr "为每一项受影响的解读创建一项依赖。指明该解读、它所依赖的命题以及处理主张；对该解读的复核是另行记录的独立行为。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PropositionDependency|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to flag exactly the reading of a proposition that a later authority claim bears on, leaving other readings of the same case untouched."
msgstr "用于恰好标记后来的权威主张所涉及的某一命题解读，而不触动同一案件的其他解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Authority Correspondence"
msgstr "权威对应"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed and scoped claim that an authority claim in one legal order corresponds to an authority claim in another. It is not an authority claim: it carries no force and transfers none, so neither legal order's interpretation is established by the other."
msgstr "一项有归属、有范围的主张，称某一法律秩序中的权威主张与另一法律秩序中的权威主张相对应。它不是权威主张：它不带有任何效力，也不转移任何效力，因此任何一个法律秩序的解释都不会由另一个确立。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:link a gmeow:AuthorityCorrespondence ; gmeow:correspondenceFrom ex:claimA ; gmeow:correspondenceTo ex:claimB ; gmeow:wasAssociatedWith ex:commentator ."
msgstr "ex:link a gmeow:AuthorityCorrespondence ; gmeow:correspondenceFrom ex:claimA ; gmeow:correspondenceTo ex:claimB ; gmeow:wasAssociatedWith ex:commentator ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it as a source of binding force or interpretation for either order, and avoid leaving it unattributed or unscoped."
msgstr "避免将其作为任一秩序的约束效力或解释的来源，也避免使其缺少归属或范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name both claims, the asserting agent with gmeow:wasAssociatedWith, the frame with gmeow:accordingTo and the scope with gmeow:correspondenceScope."
msgstr "指明两项主张，以 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 指明作出主张的主体，以 gmeow:accordingTo 指明框架，并以 gmeow:correspondenceScope 指明范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthorityCorrespondence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an identified party asserts that two legal orders speak to a comparable matter and the comparison itself must stay attributable and scoped."
msgstr "用于已确认的一方主张两个法律秩序论及可比事项，且该比较本身必须保持可归属、有范围的情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceBinding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "binding"
msgstr "有约束力"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceBinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim asserts that the proposition binds in its own legal order for the named forum. It requires a pinpoint source and a forum."
msgstr "该主张断言此命题在其自身的法律秩序中对所指名的审理机构具有约束力。它需要精确出处和审理机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForcePersuasive|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "persuasive"
msgstr "有说服力"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForcePersuasive|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim asserts that the proposition may be relied on for its reasoning without binding the forum. It requires a pinpoint source."
msgstr "该主张断言此命题可因其推理而被援引，但不约束审理机构。它需要精确出处。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceDissent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "dissent"
msgstr "异议"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceDissent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim records a proposition put forward in dissent, which does not bind the forum."
msgstr "该主张记录以异议形式提出的命题，该命题不约束审理机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "unresolved"
msgstr "未决"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForceUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim records that the authority status of the proposition is not established by the evidence supplied; the issue it leaves open is stated."
msgstr "该主张记录该命题的权威地位未被所提供的证据确立；其所遗留的未决问题已予说明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleMajority|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reasons of the deciding body"
msgstr "裁判机构的理由"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleMajority|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The proposition appears in the reasons that carry the decision of the deciding body, whether unanimous or by majority."
msgstr "该命题出现在承载裁判机构裁决的理由之中，无论是一致意见还是多数意见。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleConcurring|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "concurring reasons"
msgstr "协同意见的理由"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleConcurring|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The proposition appears in separate reasons that agree with the result."
msgstr "该命题出现在与结果一致的单独理由之中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleDissenting|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "dissenting reasons"
msgstr "异议意见的理由"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRoleDissenting|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The proposition appears in separate reasons that disagree with the result."
msgstr "该命题出现在与结果不一致的单独理由之中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityOrder|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority order"
msgstr "权威秩序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityOrder|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one legal order in which an authority claim asserts its status. Functional: a status asserted in one order is not a status in another."
msgstr "权威主张在其中陈述其地位的唯一法律秩序。函数式：在一个秩序中陈述的地位不是另一个秩序中的地位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityOrder|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authorityOrder ex:legalOrder ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authorityOrder ex:legalOrder ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityOrder|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to scope an authority claim to the legal order that grounds it."
msgstr "用于将权威主张限定于作为其依据的法律秩序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForum|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority forum"
msgstr "权威审理机构"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForum|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The court, tribunal or other body before which an authority claim asserts its status."
msgstr "权威主张就其地位所面向的法院、裁判庭或其他机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForum|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authorityForum ex:court ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authorityForum ex:court ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForum|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the forum a binding or persuasive status is asserted for."
msgstr "用于指明有约束力或有说服力的地位所针对的审理机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority force"
msgstr "权威效力"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The force an authority claim asserts for its proposition: binding, persuasive, dissent or unresolved. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "权威主张就其命题所断言的效力：有约束力、有说服力、异议或未决。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForce|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authorityForce gmeow:authorityForcePersuasive ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authorityForce gmeow:authorityForcePersuasive ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityForce|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to state which of the four forces the claim asserts."
msgstr "用于说明该主张断言四种效力中的哪一种。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "opinion role"
msgstr "意见角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The role of the opinion in which the claimed proposition appears. Functional."
msgstr "所主张命题出现于其中的意见之角色。函数式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRole|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:opinionRole gmeow:opinionRoleMajority ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:opinionRole gmeow:opinionRoleMajority ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opinionRole|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source identifies the opinion that carries the proposition."
msgstr "用于来源指明承载该命题的意见时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityIssue|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority issue"
msgstr "权威问题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityIssue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The question of law or issue on which the proposition is claimed, as text with its original language and direction. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "该命题所针对的法律问题或争点，以带有原始语言和方向的文本表示。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityIssue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authorityIssue \"the standard of review\" ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authorityIssue \"the standard of review\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityIssue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to state the issue a proposition is scoped to."
msgstr "用于陈述命题所限定的争点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authoritySource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority source"
msgstr "权威来源"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authoritySource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The citation act, with its pinpoint selector, that locates the proposition in its source. The source is evidence for the claim and is never a claim of authority by itself."
msgstr "以精确选择器在来源中定位该命题的引用行为。来源是该主张的证据，其本身绝不是权威主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authoritySource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authoritySource ex:sourceCitation ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authoritySource ex:sourceCitation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authoritySource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to point a claim at the pinpoint where its source states the proposition."
msgstr "用于使主张指向其来源陈述该命题的精确位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relevantFact|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relevant fact"
msgstr "相关事实"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relevantFact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A described circumstance of the decided matter that the proposition depends on. Several facts are read together."
msgstr "所裁决事项中该命题所依赖的一项被描述的情形。多项事实合并解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relevantFact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:relevantFact ex:materialFact ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:relevantFact ex:materialFact ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relevantFact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the facts that bound the reach of a legal proposition."
msgstr "用于记录限定某一法律命题适用范围的事实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityRule|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "authority rule"
msgstr "权威规则"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The specifically identified duty, permission or prohibition the claim concerns, as a rights rule with its assignee and action. Used only where those rights criteria apply."
msgstr "该主张所涉及的具体确定的义务、许可或禁止，以带有受让方和行为的权利规则表示。仅在适用这些权利标准时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:authorityRule ex:identifiedDuty ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:authorityRule ex:identifiedDuty ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/authorityRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the proposition identifies one duty, permission or prohibition with an assignee and an action."
msgstr "用于命题确定了带有受让方和行为的某一项义务、许可或禁止的情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyReading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "dependency reading"
msgstr "依赖解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The authority claim, a reading of a proposition, that the dependency flags for review. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "依赖所标记、需要复核的权威主张，即某一命题的一种解读。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyReading ex:earlierClaim ."
msgstr "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyReading ex:earlierClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the exact reading a treatment bears on."
msgstr "用于指明某一处理所涉及的确切解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyProposition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "dependency proposition"
msgstr "依赖命题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyProposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The proposition that the flagged reading depends on and the treating claim bears on. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "被标记的解读所依赖、且处理主张所涉及的命题。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyProposition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyProposition ex:earlierProposition ."
msgstr "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyProposition ex:earlierProposition ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyProposition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to scope a dependency to one proposition rather than to a whole case."
msgstr "用于把依赖限定于某一命题，而不是整个案件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyTreatment|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "dependency treatment"
msgstr "依赖处理"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyTreatment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The authority claim that treats the depended-on proposition. Functional and mandatory. Naming it makes no claim that it binds anything beyond its own scope."
msgstr "处理该被依赖命题的权威主张。函数式且必填。指明它并不表示其约束力超出其自身范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyTreatment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyTreatment ex:laterClaim ."
msgstr "ex:dep gmeow:dependencyTreatment ex:laterClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/dependencyTreatment|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the claim whose treatment triggers the review flag."
msgstr "用于指明其处理触发复核标记的主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceFrom|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "correspondence from"
msgstr "对应起点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The authority claim at one end of a correspondence. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "对应关系一端的权威主张。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceFrom ex:claimA ."
msgstr "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceFrom ex:claimA ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the first claim of a cross-order correspondence."
msgstr "用于指明跨秩序对应关系中的第一项主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceTo|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "correspondence to"
msgstr "对应终点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceTo|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The authority claim at the other end of a correspondence. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "对应关系另一端的权威主张。函数式且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceTo|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceTo ex:claimB ."
msgstr "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceTo ex:claimB ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceTo|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the second claim of a cross-order correspondence."
msgstr "用于指明跨秩序对应关系中的第二项主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceScope|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "correspondence scope"
msgstr "对应范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The described circumstance or subject matter within which the correspondence is asserted. Mandatory: an unscoped correspondence is not recorded."
msgstr "作出该对应所限定的被描述的情形或主题。必填：没有范围的对应不予记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceScope ex:sharedSubject ."
msgstr "ex:link gmeow:correspondenceScope ex:sharedSubject ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correspondenceScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bound what a correspondence is claimed to cover."
msgstr "用于限定一项对应所声称涵盖的内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BindingAuthoritySourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Binding authority source constraint"
msgstr "有约束力权威的来源约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BindingAuthoritySourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an authority claim of binding force names the pinpoint source of its proposition through gmeow:authoritySource."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：具有约束效力的权威主张须通过 gmeow:authoritySource 指明其命题的精确出处。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BindingAuthorityForumConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Binding authority forum constraint"
msgstr "有约束力权威的审理机构约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BindingAuthorityForumConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an authority claim of binding force names the forum it binds through gmeow:authorityForum."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：具有约束效力的权威主张须通过 gmeow:authorityForum 指明其所约束的审理机构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PersuasiveAuthoritySourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Persuasive authority source constraint"
msgstr "有说服力权威的来源约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PersuasiveAuthoritySourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an authority claim of persuasive force names the pinpoint source of its proposition through gmeow:authoritySource."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：具有说服效力的权威主张须通过 gmeow:authoritySource 指明其命题的精确出处。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DissentNotBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Dissent not binding constraint"
msgstr "异议不具约束力约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DissentNotBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: an authority claim whose opinion role is dissenting does not carry binding force."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：意见角色为异议的权威主张不带有约束效力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectEnactment|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "enactment"
msgstr "颁布"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectEnactment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The act that makes a provision part of its legal order."
msgstr "使某一条款成为其法律秩序组成部分的行为。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectCommencement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "commencement"
msgstr "施行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectCommencement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The event at which an enacted provision version begins to operate, where that is distinct from its enactment."
msgstr "已颁布的条款版本开始生效的事件；与颁布不同时才单独记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectAmendment|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "amendment"
msgstr "修正"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectAmendment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The event at which a provision version is altered, ending the earlier version and beginning a new one."
msgstr "条款版本被修改的事件，它终止先前版本并开始新版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectRepeal|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "repeal"
msgstr "废止"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectRepeal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The event at which a provision version ceases to operate without a replacement version beginning at the same event."
msgstr "条款版本停止生效、且没有替代版本在同一事件中开始的事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LegalEffectKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Legal Effect Kind"
msgstr "法律效力类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LegalEffectKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The value vocabulary of the legal act a legal effect event records: enactment, commencement, amendment or repeal."
msgstr "法律效力事件所记录法律行为的值词汇表：颁布、施行、修正或废止。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LegalEffectEvent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Legal Effect Event"
msgstr "法律效力事件"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LegalEffectEvent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An occurrence that begins or ends the operation of a provision version: its enactment, commencement, amendment or repeal. Its material date is its gmeow:eventTime. When the source gives no date the event carries none, and any applicability that depends on that date stays unestablished."
msgstr "开始或终止某条款版本效力的事件，包括其颁布、施行、修正或废止。其物质日期即 gmeow:eventTime。若来源未给出日期，事件便不带日期，依赖该日期的适用性保持未确立。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LegalEffectEvent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the legal act that began or ended a provision version, with its gmeow:effectKind and, where the source supplies it, its gmeow:eventTime."
msgstr "用于记录开始或终止某条款版本的法律行为，并在来源提供时记录其 gmeow:effectKind 与 gmeow:eventTime。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "effect kind"
msgstr "效力类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/effectKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The kind of legal act a legal effect event records. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "法律效力事件所记录的法律行为类型。函数性且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvisionVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Provision Version"
msgstr "条款版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvisionVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One version of a provision as it operates in one jurisdiction, between the legal effect events that began and ended it. Its text is sourced through a citation act and its jurisdiction is a place. A version asserts nothing about whether a matter falls under it at a given date: that is an applicability evaluation."
msgstr "条款在某一法域中生效的一个版本，位于开始和终止它的法律效力事件之间。其文本由引用行为提供来源，其法域为一个地点。版本本身不断言某事项在某日期是否属于它；这属于适用性评价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvisionVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for each version of a provision whose operating period must be bound to its enactment, commencement, amendment or repeal."
msgstr "用于条款的每个版本，其运行期间须与其颁布、施行、修正或废止相绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "version of"
msgstr "版本所属"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provision identity that a provision version is a version of. Versions of one provision share this identity, and their operating periods are kept apart by their legal effect events."
msgstr "某条款版本所属的条款身份。同一条款的各版本共享此身份，其运行期间由法律效力事件区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionJurisdiction|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "version jurisdiction"
msgstr "版本法域"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionJurisdiction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The jurisdiction in which a provision version operates. A version does not operate in another jurisdiction; each jurisdiction's version is a separate provision version. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "条款版本运行的法域。版本不在其他法域运行；每个法域的版本是独立的条款版本。函数性且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionBeganBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "version began by"
msgstr "版本开始于"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionBeganBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The legal effect event that began the operation of a provision version: its enactment, commencement or amendment. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "开始某条款版本运行的法律效力事件，即其颁布、施行或修正。函数性且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionEndedBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "version ended by"
msgstr "版本终止于"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionEndedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The legal effect event that ended the operation of a provision version: an amendment or a repeal. Functional; absent while the version has not ended."
msgstr "终止某条款版本运行的法律效力事件，即修正或废止。函数性；版本未终止时缺省。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "version source"
msgstr "版本来源"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The citation act, with its pinpoint selector, that sources the text of a provision version, such as a consolidation. The act's assertedAt is the source's publication or assertion time, which is not a material date of the version."
msgstr "提供某条款版本文本来源的引用行为及其精确选择器，例如合并文本。该行为的 assertedAt 是来源的发布或断言时间，不是版本的物质日期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TransitionRule|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Transition Rule"
msgstr "过渡规则"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TransitionRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A sourced savings or transition rule under which an earlier provision version continues to govern a saved matter after a later version has begun. It names the transition event, the version it saves, the matter and its source. It does not decide the matter."
msgstr "有来源的保留或过渡规则：较早的条款版本在较晚版本开始后，仍继续适用于被保留的事项。它指明过渡事件、被保留的版本、事项及其来源，但不裁定该事项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/TransitionRule|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use where a source states that an earlier provision version continues to govern identified matters after an amendment or repeal."
msgstr "用于来源指出较早的条款版本在修正或废止之后仍继续管辖特定事项的情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/transitionEvent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "transition event"
msgstr "过渡事件"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/transitionEvent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The legal effect event that marks the boundary of a transition rule. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "标记过渡规则边界的法律效力事件。函数性且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/savesVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "saves version"
msgstr "保留版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/savesVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The earlier provision version that continues to govern the saved matter under a transition rule. Mandatory."
msgstr "根据过渡规则，继续管辖被保留事项的较早条款版本。必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/savedMatter|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "saved matter"
msgstr "被保留事项"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/savedMatter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An event whose governing version the transition rule fixes to the version it saves, whatever the operating periods of the versions would otherwise give. Mandatory, and at least one."
msgstr "过渡规则将其管辖版本固定为所保留版本的事件，无论各版本的运行期间原本会给出何种结果。必填，至少一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/transitionSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "transition source"
msgstr "过渡来源"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/transitionSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The citation act, with its pinpoint selector, that states a transition rule in its source. A transition rule without a source is not recorded. Mandatory."
msgstr "在其来源中陈述过渡规则的引用行为及其精确选择器。没有来源的过渡规则不予记录。必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ApplicabilityEvaluation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Applicability Evaluation"
msgstr "适用性评价"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ApplicabilityEvaluation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An activity that evaluates which provision version governs a matter. Its eventTime is the evaluation time, distinct from the material dates of the legal effect events it reads and from the publication time of its sources. It records no verdict: the governing version is computed from the recorded events and transition rules."
msgstr "评价某事项由哪个条款版本管辖的活动。其 eventTime 为评价时间，区别于其所读取法律效力事件的物质日期及其来源的发布时间。它不记录结论：管辖版本由已记录的事件和规则计算得出。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ApplicabilityEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record when a governing provision version was determined for a matter, so that the evaluation time stays separate from the material dates."
msgstr "用于记录为某事项确定管辖条款版本的时间，使评价时间与物质日期保持分离。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/evaluatedMatter|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "evaluated matter"
msgstr "被评价事项"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/evaluatedMatter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The event whose governing provision version the evaluation determines. Functional and mandatory."
msgstr "评价所确定其管辖条款版本的事件。函数性且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/interpretsVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "interprets version"
msgstr "解释版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/interpretsVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provision version whose text an authority claim reads, applies or interprets. A legal effect event that ends this version is a change that affected the basis of the claim. The claim is neither retracted nor suppressed by that change, and suppressing the claim or dating its source later is not a change to the version."
msgstr "权威主张所阅读、适用或解释其文本的条款版本。终止该版本的法律效力事件是影响该主张依据的变更。该变更既不撤回也不压制该主张，压制该主张或将其来源日期后移也不构成对该版本的变更。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/interpretsVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:interpretsVersion ex:sectionVersion ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:interpretsVersion ex:sectionVersion ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/interpretsVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to tie an interpretation to the exact provision version it reads, so that the amendment or repeal that ended the version can be found from the interpretation."
msgstr "用于将解释与其所阅读的确切条款版本相联系，以便从该解释找到终止该版本的修正或废止。"
